      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEXAS BANDIT (4) was fast away from wide out with an impressive early sectional and went on to clock 30.74 in a 1.5 lengths win at this track over 530m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Great chance to get the job done again. DASHING SLAY (8) boasts a strong record this course with six wins and six minors from 15 tries. Was out of placings last time (30.92) at this track in a OPEN, finishing fifth and beaten 6 lengths. Looks one of the chances. PROCLIVITY (2) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at this track over 530m behind Paw Petrov (31.60) in a OPEN. Was in the money prior to that. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MY PICASSO (6) is in the mix after placing here at this trip last time out.",
